>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_safe_solvers`

``` hol4
simpLib.set_safe_solvers : Traverse.ssolver list -> simpset -> simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Replaces the safe solvers of a simpset.

`set_safe_solvers solvers ss` is `ss` with `solvers` as its safe
solvers, keeping only the first of several solvers with the same name.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val c = Context.snapshot();
>> val decide = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE} : Traverse.ssolver;
>>_ val ss = simpLib.add_safe_solver decide bool_ss;
>> simpLib.GEN_SIMP_TAC {safe = true} (simpLib.set_safe_solvers [] ss) []
     ([], “x < x + 1”) c;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpLib.add_safe_solver),
[`simpLib.set_unsafe_solvers`](#simpLib.set_unsafe_solvers).
